  "ruleText": "Mhp 401.01 Expiration of License. Licenses issued under this chapter shall be valid as provided in Plc 304.12.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Mhp 100) #5675, eff 7-22-93; EXPIRED: 7-22-99\n\nNew. #7625, eff 1-10-02, EXPIRED: 1-10-10\n\nNew. #9854, eff 1-25-11; ss by #10762, eff 1-22-15; ss by #14273, eff 8-19-25, EXPIRES: 8-19-35",
